    "profile_text": {
        "body": "RICHTECH ROBOTICS INC. (also listed as RICHTECH ROBOTICS INC-CL B) is a Nevada public company headquartered in Las Vegas, with SEC CIK 0001963685 and ticker RR. Its website is rolls-royce.com, which presents Rolls-Royce.\n\nThe site describes Rolls-Royce as pioneering cutting-edge technologies that deliver clean, safe and competitive solutions to meet the planet's vital power needs. It says the company has been at the forefront of innovation for more than 100 years and develops complex power and propulsion solutions for safety-critical applications in the air, at sea and on land. The site reports a $1 Billion investment in Indiana, a strategic intent with Reliance Industries to develop India's indigenous combat engine for the Advanced Medium Combat Aircraft programme, cooperation with United Kingdom National Nuclear Laboratory and Japan Atomic Energy Agency on advanced nuclear technologies, and Rolls-Royce SMR contractual commitments to deliver SMR units in Europe after signing with CEZ Group.\n\nNo litigation cases are listed for the company. No AI-specific products or MCP servers are identified in the available material.",
